    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dadkii Ilaah Oo La Qalbi Qaboojiyey",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaahiinnu wuxuu leeyahay, Dadkayga qalbi qaboojiya oo sii qalbi qaboojiya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeruusaalem qalbigeeda la hadla, oo iyada u qayliya oo u sheega in dagaalkeedu dhammaaday, iyo in xumaanteeda laga saamaxay, iyo inay dembiyadeedii oo dhan aawadood laba jibbaar gacantii Rabbiga uga heshay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa yeedhaya mid qaylinaya codkiis oo leh, Jidkii Rabbiga cidlada dhexdiisa ka hagaajiya, oo lamadegaanka dhexdiisa jid weyn Ilaahayaga aawadiis uga toosiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dooxo walba kor baa loo qaadi doonaa, oo qar iyo buur walbana waa la gaabin doonaa, waxa qalloocanna waa la toosin doonaa, oo meelaha xunxunna waxaa laga dhigi doonaa bannaan siman, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaa la muujin doonaa ammaanta Rabbiga, uunka oo dhammuna way wada arki doonaan, waayo, afkii Rabbiga ayaa saas ku hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa yeedhaya codka kan leh, Qayli. Oo isna wuxuu yidhi, Maxaan ku qayliyaa? Wax kasta oo jiidh lahu waa caws, oo wanaagsanaantiisa oo dhammuna waa sida ubaxa duurka oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cawsku wuu engegaa, ubaxuna wuu dhacaa, maxaa yeelay, neefta Rabbigu way afuuftaa, sida xaqiiqada ah dadku waa caws oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cawsku wuu engegaa, ubaxuna wuu dhacaa, laakiinse erayga Ilaaheennu weligiisba wuu waari doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaaga warka wanaagsan Siyoon u keenayow, buurta dheer kor u sii fuul, kaaga warka wanaagsan Yeruusaalem keenayow, codkaaga kor xoog ugu qaad, kor u sii qaad, oo innaba ha cabsan. Oo magaalooyinka dalka Yahuudah waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, War bal Ilaahiinna eega! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu la iman doonaa xoog weyn, oo gacantiisaa wax isaga ugu talin doonta! Bal eega, abaalgudkiisii wuu wadaa oo abaalmarintiisuna way ka soo horraysaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isagu adhigiisuu u daajin doonaa sida adhijir oo kale, naylahana gacantiisuu ku ururin doonaa, oo wuxuu ku qaadi doonaa laabtiisa, oo kuwa la nuugana qun yar buu u hor kici doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yaa biyaha sacabkiisa godan ku qiyaasay, oo samada taako ku qiyaasay, oo ciidda dhulka miisaan ku qiyaasay, oo buuraha miisaammo saaray, oo kurahana kafado ku miisaamay? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yaa Ruuxa Rabbiga la taliyey? Bal yaase intuu lataliyihiisii noqday isaga wax baray? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yuu isagu la tashaday? Oo bal yaa tacliimiyey, oo dhabbaha caddaaladda baray? Oo yaa aqoon baray, oo jidka waxgarashada tusay? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, quruumuhu waxay isaga la yihiin sida dhibic biyeed oo baaldi ku jirta oo kale, oo wuxuu ku xisaabaa sida boodh kafado dul saaran oo kale, oo bal eega, gasiiradahana wuxuu kor ugu qaadaa sida habaas fudud oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Lubnaan in la gubo kuma filla, oo xayawaankeedana qurbaan la gubo uguma filla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quruumaha oo dhammu waxay hortiisa ku yihiin sida wax aan jirin oo kale, oo waxay isaga la xisaabsan yihiin wax ka sii yar baabba' iyo waxaan waxba ahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bal yaad Ilaah u ekaysiinaysaan? Amase masaalkee baad isaga kala mid dhigaysaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkii saanac ahu sanam xardhan buu shubaa, oo dahabtumuhuna dahab buu ku dahaadhaa, oo wuxuu u tumaa silsilado lacag ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kii miskiin ah oo aan qurbaan awoodi karinuse wuxuu doortaa geed aan bololi karin, oo wuxuu doondoontaa nin saanac ah oo hagaajiya sanam xardhan oo aan dhaqaaqi karin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyeydaan ogayn? Miyeydaan maqlin? Miyaan bilowgii laydiin sheegin? Oo miyeydaan garan tan iyo aasaaskii dhulka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waa isaga kan wareegga dhulka dul fadhiya, oo dadka kor degganuna waa sida kabajaan oo kale, oo waa isaga kan samooyinka sida daah u kala fidiya, oo wuxuu u kala bixiyaa sida teendho lagu hoydo oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isagu amiirrada wuxuu ka dhigaa sida wax aan jirin oo kale, oo xaakinnada dhulkana wuxuu ka dhigaa sida wax aan waxba ahayn oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hubaal iyaga lama beerin, lamana abuurin, jirriddooduna dhulka xidid kuma yeelan, weliba wuu afuufaa, oo iyana way engegaan, oo dabaysha cirwareenta ah ayaa iyaga sida xaab oo kale u qaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kan Quduuska ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal yaad ii ekaysiinaysaan si aan ula mid noqdo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal indhihiinna kor u qaada oo eega. Yaa waxyaalahaas uumay? Waa kan ciidankooda tirada ku soo bixiya, oo kulligoodba magacyo ugu yeedha. Itaalkiisu wuu weyn yahay oo isagu wuu xoog badan yahay, oo sidaas daraaddeed midkoodna ma dhinna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Yacquubow, bal maxaad u leedahay, Reer binu Israa'iilow, bal maxaad ugu hadlaysaa, Jidkaygu Rabbiga wuu ka qarsoon yahay, oo Ilaahayna gartayda dan kama galo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War miyaadan ogayn? Oo miyaadan maqlin in Ilaaha daa'imka ah oo ah Rabbiga ah Uumaha dhulka darafyadiisa uusan itaal darnaan ama uusan daalin? Waxgarashadiisana lama baadhi karo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isagu kuwa itaalka daran xoog buu siiyaa, oo kuwa aan tabarta lahaynna tabar buu u kordhiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
